    "title": "Osage County Sheriff's Office Warns of Scam - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sunrise Reporter ,\n13 hours ago The Osage County Sheriff's Office is warning of a phone scam. They say an individual is impersonating an individual by the name of \"Lieutenant Johnson\" and the individual is claiming to be with the Osage County Sheriff's Office. They stress that this is fraudulent and the person is not with the Osage County Sheriff's Office. Read full article",
